      "data": {
        "body": "<h2>How this system works</h2><p>Everything on every tenant is a <strong>governed object</strong> edited through one contract surface. This manual is itself made of those objects and published through the same front door.</p><h2>Operate the platform</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/start\">Start here</a> — the shortest safe first change.</li><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/architecture\">Architecture</a> — shared core, isolated tenants, common envelope.</li><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/manual/publishing-schema-v1\">V1 publishing schema</a> — versions, locks, validation, review, publish, release.</li><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/manual/multisite\">Multisite generation</a> — scaffold, provision, seed, prove.</li><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/manual/testing\">Testing</a> — evidence across contract, store, export, deploy, and browser.</li><li><a href=\"https://kugel-platform.netlify.app/manual/known-gaps\">Findings</a> — verified gaps and current status.</li></ul><h2>Object type reference</h2><p>The live V1 surface has twelve governed types: <strong>page, section, navigation, taxonomy, site, template, section_template, theme, product, content_item, tracking_config, and editorial_voice</strong>.</p>"
